{"title": "Challenge to Duel", "pageid": 9397, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Challenge_to_Duel", "categories": ["Class actions", "Wisdom saving throws", "Actions which use weapon action DC", "Bonus actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_Duel\" title=\"Compelled Duel\">Compelled Duel</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Compelled_Duel.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Compelled_Duel.webp/300px-Compelled_Duel.webp, /w/images/e/e5/Compelled_Duel.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Compelled_Duel.webp/300px-Compelled_Duel.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Compelled_Duel.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Challenge to Duel</b> is a unique spell-like action which can be cast when wielding <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Duellist%27s_Prerogative\" title=\"Duellist's Prerogative\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Duellist%27s_Prerogative\" title=\"Duellist's Prerogative\">Duellist's Prerogative</a>. It allows spellcasters to compel an enemy to only attack them.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nChallenge an enemy to attack only you, inflicting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a> on the target.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (Weapon action DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Weapon_action_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Weapon action DC</a>)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_MAG_Legendary_CompelledDuel</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_Legendary_CompelledDuel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_Legendary_CompelledDuel\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Compelled_to_Duel\"> Condition: Compelled to Duel </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_to_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled to Duel (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Compelled to Duel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_to_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled to Duel (Condition)\">Compelled to Duel</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (Weapon action DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Weapon_action_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Weapon action DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> against anyone but the caster. Might start <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a> if struck by the Dueller.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Duellist%27s_Prerogative\" title=\"Duellist's Prerogative\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Duellist%27s_Prerogative\" title=\"Duellist's Prerogative\">Duellist's Prerogative</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action itself does not inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a>. Instead, every time a target creature with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_to_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled to Duel (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Compelled to Duel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_to_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled to Duel (Condition)\">Compelled to Duel</a> is hit with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Duellist%27s_Prerogative\" title=\"Duellist's Prerogative\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Duellist%27s_Prerogative_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Duellist%27s_Prerogative\" title=\"Duellist's Prerogative\">Duellist's Prerogative</a>, the passive Elegant Duellist triggers a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> to start bleeding. This saving throw roll is not shown in the combat log.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite being listed as a level 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Enchantment_(school)\" title=\"Enchantment (school)\">Enchantment</a> spell (inherited from parent spell <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_Duel\" title=\"Compelled Duel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp/20px-Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp/40px-Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Compelled Duel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp/20px-Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Compelled_Duel_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_Duel\" title=\"Compelled Duel\">Compelled Duel</a>), this action is not technically a spell (the <code>IsSpell</code> flag and <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">concentration</a> requirement from Compelled Duel has been removed). Thus, it does not interact with any spell-specific effects such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vivacious_Cloak\" title=\"Vivacious Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vivacious_Cloak\" title=\"Vivacious Cloak\">Vivacious Cloak</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Split_Enchantment\" title=\"Split Enchantment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp/20px-Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp/30px-Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp/40px-Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Split Enchantment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp/20px-Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Split_Enchantment_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Split_Enchantment\" title=\"Split Enchantment\">Split Enchantment</a>.\n<ul><li>It also uses <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Weapon_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">weapon action DC</a> instead of spellcasting DC and hence benefits from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heightened_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Heightened Manoeuvre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heightened Manoeuvre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heightened_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Heightened Manoeuvre\">Heightened Manoeuvre</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034049\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.119 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5637/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 74851/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 30834/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.049/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1721961/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  107.408      1 -total\n 99.25%  106.600      1 Template:Feature_page\n 83.42%   89.597     69 Template:Trim\n 22.84%   24.529      3 Template:SmRarityItem\n 19.70%   21.155      4 Template:Item_icon\n 14.75%   15.842    